WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,900
Where did this thing come from? It’s so useful.

2
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:12,060
Very convenient

3
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:13,940
It's also the first time I've seen this thing

4
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:22,730
The store is still open

5
00:00:23,130 --> 00:00:25,770
There are sellers of tofu curds, grilled sausages, and rice sellers.

6
00:00:25,970 --> 00:00:27,250
There are also pancakes and fried dumplings.

7
00:00:27,650 --> 00:00:29,010
Supermarkets are also open normally

8
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:37,300
Leave a few people here to watch

9
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:39,140
I'm buying some supplies in the area

10
00:00:39,770 --> 00:00:44,700
By the way, I want to see if there are any hot meals. Count me in. You are still young.

11
00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:49,420
It wasn't safe to get in the car and wait in the past. Then I'll go too, senior sister.

12
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:50,820
You stay here and watch

13
00:00:53,410 --> 00:00:56,170
Then you should pay attention to your safety. Don’t worry.
